      "thesis": "Strong intraday trends in Nifty50 stocks persist due to herding behavior and information cascades. When price is above both EMA(20) and EMA(50) on 1-min, and the 20 is above the 50, pullbacks to the EMA(20) offer high-probability continuation entries. Institutional order flow that initiated the tren",
      "indicators": [
        "ema_20",
        "ema_50",
        "adx_14",
        "rsi_14",
        "atr_20"
      ],
      "entry_long": [
        "ema_20 > ema_50",
        "adx_14 > 25",
        "low <= ema_20 * 1.001 (touches or nears EMA 20)",
        "close > ema_20 (bounces off EMA 20)",
        "rsi_14 < 65",
        "close > vwap"
      ],
      "entry_short": [
        "ema_20 < ema_50",
        "adx_14 > 25",
        "high >= ema_20 * 0.999",
        "close < ema_20",
