      "thesis": "The first pullback in a new intraday trend (defined as 0.5%+ move from open in the first 45 min) is the highest-probability continuation entry. Early institutional flow that initiated the trend creates a 'base' of positioned traders. The first pullback attracts profit-takers, but the remaining insti",
